          <strong>Medical School:</strong> Central University of Venezuela, Luis Razetti School of Medicine, Caracas,
          Venezuela<br>
          <strong>Fellowship:</strong> Aesthetic Plastic Surgery, University of Illinois, Chicago, Illinois<br>
          <strong>Fellowship:</strong> Complex Oncologic Reconstructive Microsurgery, Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer
          Center, New York City, New York<br>
          <strong>Residency:</strong> Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery, Tel Aviv University, Tel Aviv Sourasky Medical
          Center, Tel Aviv-Yafo, Israel
        </p>

